# Anyray end-to-end benchmarks — environment
#
# Every workload is sent twice: straight to the provider, and through the gateway
# below. There is no default gateway on purpose — name the deployment you mean.
ANYRAY_GATEWAY_URL=

# Credentials. By default the harness uses passthrough auth: the Anyray client key
# (ark_…) from ~/.anyray/connect.json for the gateway, and the Claude subscription
# OAuth token from the macOS keychain as the upstream credential on BOTH sides.
# Override either (an sk-ant-api… key works for the upstream):
# ANYRAY_CLIENT_KEY=
#
# A client key dedicated to benchmark traffic, used by the agent benchmark's Anyray arm
# in preference to ANYRAY_CLIENT_KEY. The gateway keeps regret-guard verdicts, session
# cooloffs and holdouts per tenant, and the tenant comes from the key, so a key in its
# own tenant keeps experiments from inheriting each other's state. Without it the run
# warns and records tenant "default". ANYRAY_BENCH_TENANT names that key's tenant for
# the result (the gateway does not tell the client).
# ANYRAY_BENCH_CLIENT_KEY=
# ANYRAY_BENCH_TENANT=
# ANYRAY_UPSTREAM_TOKEN=
# ANYRAY_AUTH_MODE=passthrough        # or 'managed' if the gateway holds the provider key
# ANYRAY_PROVIDER=anthropic

# Optional overrides of config.yaml `run`:
# ANYRAY_LIVE_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8
# ANYRAY_JUDGE_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8
# ANYRAY_DIRECT_URL=https://api.anthropic.com
# ANYRAY_ORDER=alternate              # alternate | direct-first | gateway-first

# Admin API key (aak_…) for the agent benchmark: reads the org optimizer config and each
# request's optimizer pipeline (traces:read, optimizer:read), and lets
# tools/bench-rule.mjs turn strategies on for benchmark traffic only (optimizer:write).
# With spend:read it also reads the gateway's own spend on each session (keep-warm pings),
# and the health report's replica start times flag a round the gateway restarted under.
# ANYRAY_ADMIN_KEY=

# Extra gateway headers for the agent benchmark's Anyray arm, one "name: value" per line.
# ANYRAY_BENCH_EXTRA_HEADERS=
